# Allowlist: no .git, manuals, test fixtures, databases or host credentials enter the build context.
**
!src/
!src/MglConnect.Web/
!src/MglConnect.Web/**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
**/bin/**
**/obj/**
**/appsettings*.json
**/.env*
**/secrets/**
**/keys/**
**/uploads/**
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
